# Dev tools — the placers/editors/generators already committed stay tracked
# (.gitignore can't untrack them); this ignores their scratch exports + any new
# tools so they don't clutter `git status`. Use `git add -f tools/<file>` to
# commit a genuinely new tool.
tools/

# Claude Code local state (ignore everything under .claude EXCEPT shared project skills)
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
